{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"民数记","commonName":"民数记","title":"民数记","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"ba1ab46e42e784cde98e7b69dca91399dcc7d758951f802d5da0412989293c76","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1267},"chapter":{"number":23,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴兰的预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["巴兰对巴勒说：“你在这里为我筑七座祭坛，预备七头公牛和七只公绵羊。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["巴勒就照巴兰的话做了。他们二人在每座坛上献上一头公牛和一只公绵羊，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["巴兰对巴勒说：“你留在燔祭旁边，我到前面去，也许耶和华会向我显现。无论祂有什么指示，我必告诉你。”巴兰就上到一处光秃秃的高地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["上帝向巴兰显现。巴兰对上帝说：“我已经预备了七座祭坛，每座祭坛上献了一头公牛和一只公绵羊。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华告诉他当说的话，命他回去转告巴勒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["巴兰就回到巴勒那里，看见他和摩押的官长都站在燔祭旁边。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["巴兰吟诗预言说：",{"text":"“巴勒领我出亚兰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押王请我出东山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说，‘来为我咒诅雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"来斥责以色列！’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝没有咒诅的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能咒诅？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华没有斥责的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能斥责？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我从峰顶观看他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从高岗眺望他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这独居一方之民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不与万国同列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的子孙多如尘土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能数得清？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能数清以色列人的四分之一？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我愿像义人一样死去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如义人般终此一生。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["巴勒对巴兰说：“你这是做什么？我请你来咒诅我的仇敌，你竟祝福他们！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["巴兰说：“耶和华让我说的话，我岂能不说？”"]},{"type":"heading","content":["巴兰第二次预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["巴勒说：“请你跟我去另一个地方，那里看不见全部以色列人，只能看见一部分，你要在那里为我咒诅他们。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他领巴兰上到毗斯迦山顶的琐腓田，在那里筑了七座祭坛，每座坛上都献了一头公牛和一只公绵羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["巴兰对巴勒说：“你留在这些燔祭旁边，我到那边去见耶和华。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶和华向巴兰显现，告诉他当说的话，让他转告巴勒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["巴兰回到巴勒那里，看见他和摩押的官长都站在燔祭旁边。巴勒问道：“耶和华说了什么？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["巴兰吟诗预言说：",{"text":"“巴勒啊，要留心听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西拨的儿子啊，请听我言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝并非世人，祂不撒谎；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝不是凡人，祂不反悔。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂言出必行，信守承诺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我奉命祝福，祂已赐福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不能改变。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的子孙中未见有罪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人中看不见有祸患。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的上帝耶和华与他们同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们向自己的君王欢呼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝带他们出埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂","poem":1},{"noteId":10},{"text":"的力量如野牛之角。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有邪术能害雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有咒语可伤以色列。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"时候一到，人们必谈论雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谈论以色列，说，‘看啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝的作为何等伟大！’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，这民族挺身如母狮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"跃起像雄狮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不吞食猎物、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不喝猎物的血不躺卧。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["巴勒对巴兰说：“你可以不咒诅他们，但也不该为他们祝福啊！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["巴兰回答说：“我不是说过，我必须按耶和华的指示做吗？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["巴勒说：“来吧，我带你去另一个地方，也许上帝会同意你在那里为我咒诅他们。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["他领着巴兰登上俯瞰旷野的毗珥山顶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["巴兰对巴勒说：“你在这里为我筑七座祭坛，预备七头公牛和七只公绵羊。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["巴勒就照巴兰的话，在每座祭坛上献了一头公牛和一只公绵羊。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"“祂”有古卷作“他们”。","reference":{"chapter":23,"verse":22}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":30}